  "note": "Writes CMD_SD_EMMC_DEMUX_SD_ON (1) or CMD_SD_EMMC_DEMUX_EMMC_ON (0) to FABRIC_SD_EMMC_DEMUX_SELECT_ADDRESS (0x4FFFFF00; 0x4F000000 before reference design 2022.09, mss_io_config.h). The fabric drives SDIO_SW_SEL0 (D7), SDIO_SW_SEL1 (C7), SDIO_SW_EN_N (B7) to U29/U44.",
